  "question": "Consider the function \\(f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d\\), where \\(a,b,c,d\\) are real numbers with \\(a>0\\). If \\(f\\) is strictly increasing, then the function \\(g(x)=f'(x)-f''(x)+f'''(x)\\) is",
