    "A": "zero for some \\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)",
    "B": "positive for all \\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)",
    "C": "negative for all \\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)",
    "D": "strictly increasing."
  },
  "answer": "B",
